      "type": "lg-ap-faq",
      "settings": {
        "no_top": true,
        "eyebrow": "Before you pick",
        "heading": "Find your size",
        "body": "Get it wrong and you've got thirty days to send it back, unworn with the tags on.",
        "cols": "even"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How does it fit?",
            "a": "<p>It's an athletic fit, so it sits closer than a boxy golf polo, and the four-way stretch makes it more forgiving than the cut suggests. If you wear a large in a performance polo, a large here's right. Between sizes, or want room across the chest? Size up.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Classic collar or Blade collar?",
            "a": "<p>The Blade has no buttons and no placket, so there's nothing at your throat. Everything else is the same shirt: athletic fit, 88/12 poly-spandex, four-way stretch and UPF 50+. You're picking a collar and a print.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What's it made of?",
            "a": "<p>88% polyester and 12% spandex, with four-way stretch. It's moisture-wicking, wrinkle-resistant and UPF 50+. Machine wash cold, tumble dry low.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What if the size is wrong?",
            "a": "<p>Send it back within thirty days, unworn with the tags on.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
